      <mj-text align="left" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" color="#002771" line-height="1.3" padding="0">Suitable For</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text align="left" font-size="14px" color="#61667C" line-height="1.6" padding="0">Businesses selling online to overseas customers who want <b style="color:#03102F;">higher conversion at checkout</b> - without managing separate payment links per currency.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 24px">
    <mj-column padding="0">
      <mj-raw><table class="col-wrap" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td width="173" class="col-card" valign="top" bgcolor="#F5F7FC" align="center" style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 12px;width:173px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">🛒</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#002771;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Cross-Border E-Commerce</div><p style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.5;margin:4px 0 0 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Sell to overseas shoppers without creating a separate link per currency</p>
        </td><td width="8" class="col-spacer" style="width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0;"> </td><td width="173" class="col-card" valign="top" bgcolor="#F5F7FC" align="center" style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 12px;width:173px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">🎓</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#002771;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Online Course Sellers</div><p style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.5;margin:4px 0 0 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Let international students check out in a currency they recognize</p>
        </td><td width="8" class="col-spacer" style="width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0;"> </td><td width="173" class="col-card" valign="top" bgcolor="#F5F7FC" align="center" style="background-color:#F5F7FC;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 12px;width:173px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">🧾</div><div style="text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#002771;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Regional Service Providers</div><p style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.5;margin:4px 0 0 0;font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;">Bill clients across markets, get paid the same way every time</p>
        </td></tr></tbody></table></mj-raw>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
